        "before": "live=\"polite\" class=\"sw-track\"><a class=\"sw-item is-on\" href=\"editions/2026-11-16.html#s1\">A Fed Official Says Inflation Is Moving in the Wrong Direction</a><a class=\"sw-item\" href=\"editions/2026-11-16.html#s2\">A Vulcan Rocket Fails After Liftoff and Destroys 40 Amazon Satellites</a><a class=\"sw-item\" href=\"editions/2026-11-16.html#s3\">Estonia Will Close Its Border Crossings With Russia After a Suspected Arson Attempt</a><a class=\"sw-item\" href=\"editions/2026-11-16.html#s4\">Huge Crowds Rally in Prague Against a Plan to Change Public Media Funding</a><a class=\"sw-item\" href=\"editions/2026-11-16.html#deep-dive\">Why Congo&#x27;s Ebola Outbreak Is Still Out of Control After Six Months</a></div><div class=\"sw-ctrl\"><button aria-label=\"Previous headline\" class=\"sw-prev\" type=\"button\">‹</button><span class=\"sw-dots\"><button aria-label=\"Show headline 1\" type=\"button\"></button><button aria-label=\"Show headline 2\" type=\"button\"></button><button aria-label=\"Show headline 3\" type=\"button\"></button><button aria-label=\"Show headline 4\" type=\"button\"></button><button aria-label=\"Show headline 5\" type=\"button\"></button></span><button aria-label=\"Next headline\" class=\"sw-next\" type=\"button\">›</button></div></div></div>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow\">Your daily news, distilled</p>\n<h1 id=\"hero-title\">Less scrolling.<br><span>More knowing.</span></h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">The headlines that matter, with the context to make sense of them. One free email, every morning, in about five minutes.</p>\n<div id=\"signup\"><form class=\"subscribe\" id=\"top\" method=\"post\" action=\"https://www.aweber.com/scripts/addlead.pl\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"listname\" value=\"awlist6982848\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"redirect\" value=\"https://thedailyskim.com/thanks.html\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"meta_redirect_onlist\" value=\"https://thedailyskim.com/thanks.html?already=1\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"meta_adtracking\" value=\"landing-page-top\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"meta_message\" value=\"1\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"meta_required\" value=\"email\">\n<label class=\"sr\" for=\"email-top\">Email address</label>\n<div class=\"row\"><input id=\"email-top\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" required><button type=\"submit\">Get the Daily Skim</button></div>\n<p class=\"reassure\">Free. One email a day. Unsubscribe anytime with one click. See our <a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>\n</form></div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"topics\" aria-label=\"What we cover\"><ul class=\"wrap\"><li>U.S. news</li><li>World</li><li>Business &amp; markets</li><li>Tech &amp; AI</li><li>Science</li><li>Health</li><li>Culture</li></ul></nav>\n<section class=\"block wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"inside-title\">\n<div class=\"head\"><h2 id=\"inside-title\">Inside the email</h2><p>Same simple format, every morning.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<div class=\"part\"><b>01</b><h3>The Big Read</h3><p>The day's biggest stories, led by the top story in America, each cut to the facts with links to the reporting.</p></div>\n<div class=\"part\"><b>02</b><h3>The Briefing</h3><p>Quick, sourced one liners on world news, money, science, sports and culture.</p></div>\n<div class=\"part\"><b>03</b><h3>Deep Dive and Trivia</h3><p>One story explained in full, then a quick question tied to the day's news.</p></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"block wrap\" id=\"editions\" aria-labelledby=\"ed-title\">\n<div class=\"head\"><h2 id=\"ed-title\">Recent editions</h2><p>Read them free. Every fact is linked to its source.</p></div>\n<div class=\"grid\" id=\"edition-grid\"></div>\n<noscript><p><a href=\"editions/2026-11-16.html\">Read the latest edition</a></p></noscript>\n</section>\n<section class=\"block wrap about\" aria-labelle