le\">News without the noise.</h2>\n<div><p><strong>The Daily Skim is a free morning email for busy, curious people.</strong> We read the news so you don't have to scroll through it, then cut each story down to what actually matters.</p>\n<p>No hot takes and no clickbait. Just clear, sourced reporting from outlets like AP, Reuters, CBS News and ABC News, with links so you can read further whenever you want.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"block wrap faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n<div class=\"head\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\">Questions</h2></div>\n<details><summary>What will I receive?</summary><p>One email each morning with the five stories that matter most, each cut to the facts and linked to its sources, plus a quick trivia question.</p></details><details><summary>Is it free?</summary><p>Yes. The Daily Skim is free to read.</p></details><details><summary>How long does it take to read?</summary><p>About five minutes. Every story is cut to what you need to know, with links if you want to go deeper.</p></details><details><summary>Can I see an example?</summary><p>Yes. Read any of the <a href=\"#editions\">recent editions</a> above. They are the same format you will get by email.</p></details><details><summary>Can I unsubscribe?</summary><p>Anytime. Every email has a one click unsubscribe link at the bottom.</p></details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"final\" aria-labelledby=\"final-title\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2 id=\"final-title\">Start tomorrow better informed.</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Five minutes. Free. In your inbox before your coffee is ready.</p>\n<form class=\"subscribe\" id=\"bottom\" method=\"post\" action=\"https://www.aweber.com/scripts/addlead.pl\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"listname\" value=\"awlist6982848\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"redirect\" value=\"https://thedailyskim.com/thanks.html\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"meta_redirect_onlist\" value=\"https://thedailyskim.com/thanks.html?already=1\">\n<inpu